NOTICE — 06-build-training-dataset
==================================

WHAT THIS IS

A coursework exercise: a small but complete training data execution system --
tokenized shards, manifests, a mixture schedule, packing, ledgers, checkpoints,
crash recovery, replay and audit. It is a study of how such a system is built and
proved, not a product, not a proposal to any organisation, and not infrastructure
anybody operates. No large model has been trained with it.

